00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.219
Trump flinches.

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:53.899
It's all a comedy of errors.

00:00:53.899 --> 00:00:55.149
It's very visual, I admit.

00:00:55.149 --> 00:00:59.460
But let's take a look at it.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:06.010
That's fantastic.

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:13.140
And so that was something.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:19.650
