00:01:57.890 --> 00:01:59.890
I'm really, really exciting stuff.

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:04.630
So Trump says 17 times faster than what we
have right now.

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:09.110
So I believe that our fastest missile right
