00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:51.620
He declined to comment to the White House.

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:54.400
So you can say what the president was describing.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.852
Yeah, I was just referring back to the president,
Mark remarks in the Pentagon.

00:02:57.852 --> 00:03:00.350
